  "problems": "The first column is headed 'Waist' but holds the denim size (23-34) and is identical in the INCH and CM tables, so it is a size label, not a measured waist; waist is therefore null. Letter size, hip and bust cells span two denim sizes (rowspan), so both sizes in each pair share the same hip/bust range. Sizes 26 and 27 are both published as US 4 (no US 4/6 split). The XXL hip/bust cells have rowspan=2 but there is no size 35 row. The page gives no body-vs-garment wording; 'body' is inferred from the range format. Inches also published (hip 33, 34-35, 36-37, 38-39, 40-41.5, 42.5-44, 45-46.5; bust 30, 31-32, 33-34, 35-36, 37-38.5, 39.5-41, 42-43.5). No inseam chart."
